d  godfrey from the lands between to die  she sentenced her own half-brother  malaketh to seal away the rune of death  for reasons unknown to him that defied  the greater will she hid two of her  children morgot and moog in the sewers  below the capital city because of their  omen birth defects now this was likely  at the request of the greater will and  its customs potentially but she did it  nonetheless as sad as it is to say i  don't think it's too far of a stretch  that america would allow ronnie to kill  godwin for the sake of their plan we  don't know much about godwin before the  knight of black knives what we can  assume just from the given title as  godwin the golden is that he was a  valuable asset to the golden order he  would have been against queen america's  plan we can take from all of this  information which i should remind you is  mainly speculation at this point that  queen america let ronnie use godwin to  complete her ritual and kill her  imperial flesh removing her from the  influence of the two fingers this ritual  was known as the knight of black knives  where daggers imbued with the fragment  of the rune of death were pierced into  ronnie and godwin at the same time this  killed ronnie's body leaving just her  spirit to roam free as she wished and  this also killed godwin's spirit leaving  only his lifeless body behind queen  america always knew that she would  shatter the elden ring the success of  this plan as we've discussed depended on  many different variables going according  to plan and up to this point in the  timeline everything has gone according  to plan for the most part ronnie waited  for queen america to set the final act  of their plan into motion queen america  knew that the shattering would cause  defiance of the greater will her other  half ratagon for wars between many  different factions and her demigod  children and it would mean the return of  the tarnished to the lands between this  was the culmination of her entire plan  for us the tarnished to return to the  lands between and have a choice to make  a choice that would determine the future  of quite literally everything she knew  that we would struggle she knew we'd be  manipulated by many different characters  she knew we'd have difficult choices to  make she knew that we'd have to kill her  own children and she knew that we'd  eventually have to kill her all of this  didn't matter because no matter what  path we decide to go down no matter what  ending that we choose it would lead to  what she wanted it would lead to change  a change that would test the faith of  everyone in the lands between it would  eventually lead to the strongest  becoming the new elden lord as we come  down to the end godfrey is met with the  same destiny as we are he knows the  struggle we have endured as he's endured  it himself does godfrey know america's  plan probably not he just knows as much  as we do as fellow tarnished we must  mend the elden ring but america gave us  a choice to mend it in any way we see  fit after we defeat godfrey he  complements our strength and goes down  honorably in defeat  faith  tarnished  my strength  this line by godfrey seems to be the  theme of america's plan the strongest  survive she started to harbor doubts  against the greater will and wanted to  test its strength through this  complicated plan that she orchestrated  ronnie's ending brings up the weaknesses  of the greater will  here making it the chill night that  encompasses all  reaching the great beyond  into fear  doubt  and loneliness when ronnie says this  she's referring to how the golden order  did not allow the people of the lands  between to feel any of these emotions  the greater will controlled everyone's  faith their own thoughts their emotions  under ronnie's ending or better known as  the age of the stars ronnie will allow  everyone to feel as they feel they can  decide for themselves what they wish to  feel believe and think it allows them  freedom and a great change was needed to  be rid of the greater will and usher in  a new era one that will last 1 000 years  under the wisdom of the full moon this  freedom of change is exactly what  america wanted for her people and  intertwines into ronnie's ending almost  perfectly but ultimately the ending was  up to us this was our own journey that  housed our own path decisions doubts and  struggles as a tarnished america let us  decide the fate of the world just as she  had planned from the very start  you all for watching the video i really  hope you enjoyed it this was very much  my most ambitious video yet so leave a  like and subscribe if you'd like to see  more have a great rest of your day and  i'll see you all in the next video take  care  [Music]
 

